# Build context is the repository root; only the web app and the container files are needed.
*
!webapp
!deploy/vibemost/nginx
!deploy/vibemost/docker-entrypoint.d

**/node_modules
**/.rollup.cache
**/.parcel-cache
webapp/channels/dist
webapp/platform/*/dist
webapp/platform/*/lib
# Local TypeScript build state: with it, tsc treats the excluded outputs as up to date and
# emits nothing, so the platform package builds fail.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
